==Battleground==
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Blinky Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
-

==='''Recommended Cats'''===
*Any [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield Cat]] - Since Blinky Kory is present, bringing a Wave Shield Cat is very useful to negate its waves from reaching your backliners.
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] - With the presence of the Zombie trait, Shigong is incredibly useful for tanking and dealing damage to the Zrocos, Clyde Gories, and Zir Zeal. Shigong may also land the [[Z-Killer]] ability for clearing the Zrocos and opening up the stage for your other units to damage Blinky Kory.

